        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `parse_json_secret.py` that retrieves and parses a JSON-formatted secret using a concrete external provider, I need to select a provider that offers secret management services. AWS Secrets Manager is a suitable choice for this task. The code will use the `boto3` library to interact with AWS Secrets Manager, which will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
